<title>FINLAND: ASKO 8-MTH PROFIT RISES 42 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>ASKO 8-MTH PROFIT RISES 42 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight months to end-August, 1996</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after fin items		  195.6 vs 137.0</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)	   20.00 vs 14.00</p>
<p> Net sales				 4,866.8 vs 4,585.6</p>
<p> Operating profit			  339.6 vs 322.9</p>
<p> Depreciation				261.4 vs 247.1</p>
<p> Net financial items	    charge 144.0 vs 185.9 charge</p>
<p> Extraordinary items	     charge 20.0 vs 20.0 charge</p>
<p> Taxes					  52.6 vs 39.7</p>
<p> Net profit				  125.8 vs 77.3</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)     29.0 vs 28.0 at end-1995</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish plastic pipe, furniture and</p>
<p>white goods group is Asko Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 80 6805 0245</p>
</text>
